// Anezka_7_2_196              It appears I am once again in thy debt, brave sir, for coming to us in our time of need

// Christof_7_2_197            As I am in thy debt, for saving my life with thy tender care. And for thy uncommon valor in standing with me 'gainst the forces of hell.
// Anezka_7_2_198              I pray, milord, that thou art always near, to deliver us from this evil.
// Christof_7_2_199            Milady, I pledge my arm to thy cause, for as long as I draw breath, and beyond.
// Anezka_7_2_200              Then I have faith in the safety of our humble convent.
