// Ecat_7_2_201                His skill is great, and he fights with the strength of a demon.
// Cosmas_7_2_202              His courage has opened the mines again. Think of how the gift of Caine would enhance the might of such a man!
// Ecat_7_2_203                Aye, he has done great service to the Promethian cause by dispatching Ahzra without our involvement. But this decision must be made with surpassing care.
// Cosmas_7_2_204              With so many of us missing, we need his sword in the coming tumult. The other clans are surely considering him for the Embrace by now.
